title: "Ophamin: a falsifiability-first experimentation framework with signed, cross-language-verifiable empirical proof records"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ben Slama"
    given-names: "Idir"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"  # replace with your real ORCID
